# Analytic: flat circular membrane clamped at radius 50, t0 1, Ogden HIPS (Erchiqui & Kandil Table 2), stress scale S = 1 MPa, inflated to P = p a/(S t0) = 0.258062.
# Reference: s1_ref_inflation_ogden_hips_erchiqui_kandil.csv (Adkins & Rivlin, RK4, 7 digits). Notes: ref_inflation_ogden_hips.notes.md.
sketch plan(on: xy) {
  rim = circle((0, 0), 50)
}
cav = extrude(plan, -250)
law = thermo_material("ref_inflation_ogden_hips", law: [(ratio(0.17435), ratio(1.85226)), (ratio(0.10469), ratio(0.01498)), (ratio(0.52915), ratio(-0.02208))], law_temperature: 150)
part = thermoform(cav, t: 1, material: law, tool: "female", flange: 10, shrink: ratio(0), vent: false, temperature: 150, pressure: ratio(0.005161))
